<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<style>body{margin:0}[hidden]{display:none!important}img{max-width:100%}</style>
<title>Zarishields</title>
<meta name="claude:viewport-fit-sides" content="cover">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap">
<style>
/* Layout: guide column on the left and a phone-sized app card on the right on wide screens; app card first, guide below on phones.
   Palette: green-tinted greys, dark green accent, separate green / amber / red for check results. Type: Bricolage Grotesque display, DM Sans body, IBM Plex Mono for codes. */
:root {
  --bg: #F1F5F2;
  --surface: #FFFFFF;
  --ink: #16211A;
  --muted: #566A5D;
  --line: #D6E2D9;
  --accent: #14633C;
  --accent-ink: #FFFFFF;
  --accent-soft: #D9EEE0;
  --ok: #12703A;
  --ok-soft: #DDF1E4;
  --warn: #8F5400;
  --warn-soft: #FBEBCB;
  --bad: #B3261E;
  --bad-soft: #FBDDDA;
  --font-display: 'Bricolage Grotesque', 'Avenir Next', system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-body: 'DM Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  --font-mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
    --bg: #0E1511; --surface: #18231C; --ink: #EAF3ED; --muted: #A2B5A8; --line: #2A3A30;
    --accent: #5CC98C; --accent-ink: #06200F; --accent-soft: #173625;
    --ok: #62D190; --ok-soft: #17301F; --warn: #F2BA60; --warn-soft: #33260D; --bad: #FF8F85; --bad-soft: #3A1715;
    color-scheme: dark;
  }
}
:root[data-theme="dark"] {
  --bg: #0E1511; --surface: #18231C; --ink: #EAF3ED; --muted: #A2B5A8; --line: #2A3A30;
  --accent: #5CC98C; --accent-ink: #06200F; --accent-soft: #173625;
  --ok: #62D190; --ok-soft: #17301F; --warn: #F2BA60; --warn-soft: #33260D; --bad: #FF8F85; --bad-soft: #3A1715;
  color-scheme: dark;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink);
  font: 15px/1.5 var(--font-body);
  padding-block: 16px;
  padding-left: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left, 0px));
  padding-right: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right, 0px));
}
button, input, select { font: inherit; color: inherit; }
button { cursor: pointer; }
:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
.ico { width: 22px; height: 22px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; flex: none; }

.stage { display: grid; gap: 24px; max-width: 980px; margin-inline: auto; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
@media (min-width: 860px) {
  .stage { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 400px; align-items: start; }
  .guide { order: -1; padding-top: 8px; }
  .app { position: sticky; top: 16px; }
}

/* App card */
.app {
  width: 100%; max-width: 420px; margin-inline: auto;
  height: min(780px, calc(100svh - 32px)); min-height: 600px;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden;
  background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 28px;
  box-shadow: 0 24px 48px -28px rgba(22, 33, 26, .35);
}
.app-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 14px 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font: 700 19px var(--font-display); letter-spacing: -.01em; }
.brand .ico { width: 26px; height: 26px; color: var(--accent); stroke-width: 2; }
.pill { font: 500 11px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 99px; background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent); }
.screens { flex: 1; min-height: 0; overflow-y: auto; padding: 18px; }
.screen { display: grid; gap: 14px; align-content: start; }
.screen h1 { font: 700 26px/1.1 var(--font-display); letter-spacing: -.02em; text-wrap: balance; margin: 0; }
.lede { color: var(--muted); margin: -6px 0 0; }
.small { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }
h2.label { font: 500 11px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin: 6px 0 0; }

/* Buttons */
.btn { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; width: 100%; min-height: 48px; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 14px; border: 1.5px solid var(--accent); background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); font-weight: 700; }
.btn.ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--accent); }
.btn.sm { min-height: 40px; width: auto; padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 14px; }
.link { background: none; border: 0; padding: 0; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }

.tile { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 40px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 12px; align-items: center; text-align: left; width: 100%; padding: 13px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; }
.tile .badge { width: 40px; height: 40px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent); }
.tile strong { display: block; font-weight: 700; }
.tile span.d { display: block; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }

/* Status chips and result cards */
.panel { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 4px 14px; }
.row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 0; }
.row + .row { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
.chip { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 99px; white-space: nowrap; }
.chip.ok { background: var(--ok-soft); color: var(--ok); }
.chip.warn { background: var(--warn-soft); color: var(--warn); }
.chip.bad { background: var(--bad-soft); color: var(--bad); }
.chip.none { background: var(--bg); color: var(--muted); }
.result { border: 1.5px solid; border-radius: 16px; padding: 14px; display: grid; gap: 10px; }
.result p { margin: 0; }
.result.ok { background: var(--ok-soft); border-color: var(--ok); }
.result.warn { background: var(--warn-soft); border-color: var(--warn); }
.result.bad { background: var(--bad-soft); border-color: var(--bad); }
.result .r-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font: 700 18px var(--font-display); }
.result.ok .r-head { color: var(--ok); }
.result.warn .r-head { color: var(--warn); }
.result.bad .r-head { color: var(--bad); }
.result .btn { background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--line); }
.kv { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 4px 12px; margin: 0; font-size: 13.5px; }
.kv dt { color: var(--muted); }
.kv dd { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.err { color: var(--bad); font-weight: 500; margin: 0; }

/* Forms */
.field { display: grid; gap: 6px; }
.field > label, fieldset legend { font: 500 11px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); padding: 0; }
input[type="text"], select, .field input { width: 100%; min-height: 48px; padding: 10px 14px; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--surface); }
input.mono { font-family: var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
fieldset { border: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 8px; min-width: 0; }
.check { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-height: 40px; padding: 6px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; }
.check input { width: 18px; height: 18px; accent-color: var(--accent); }
.chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
.fill { font: 500 12.5px var(--font-mono); padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg); }

/* pH strip */
.steps { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: grid; gap: 4px; }
.swatches { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px; }
.sw { aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 12px; border: 0; font: 700 15px var(--font-mono); display: grid; place-items: center; }
.sw[aria-pressed="true"] { outline: 3px solid var(--ink); outline-offset: 2px; }
.range { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font: 500 11px var(--font-mono); color: var(--muted); margin-top: -6px; }

/* SMS and USSD */
.seg { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4px; padding: 4px; background: var(--bg); border-radius: 12px; }
.seg button { min-height: 40px; border: 0; border-radius: 9px; background: transparent; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); }
.seg button[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--line); }
.thread { display: grid; gap: 8px; align-content: start; min-height: 230px; max-height: 300px; overflow-y: auto; padding: 12px; background: var(--bg); border-radius: 16px; }
.bubble { max-width: 88%; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.bubble.out { justify-self: end; background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; }
.bubble.in { justify-self: start; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; }
.send-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 8px; }
.dial { font: 500 22px var(--font-mono); text-align: center; padding: 18px 0; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; background: var(--bg); letter-spacing: .04em; }
.ussd { border: 1.5px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 16px; padding: 14px; display: grid; gap: 12px; background: var(--surface); }
.ussd pre { margin: 0; font: 400 14px/1.5 var(--font-mono); white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.ussd-actions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; }

/* Bottom nav */
.nav { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); }
.nav button { display: grid; justify-items: center; align-content: center; gap: 2px; min-height: 58px; padding: 6px 2px; background: none; border: 0; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }
.nav button[aria-current="page"] { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }

/* Guide */
.guide h2 { font: 700 30px/1.1 var(--font-display); letter-spacing: -.02em; margin: 0 0 10px; text-wrap: balance; }
.guide h3 { font: 500 11px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin: 26px 0 10px; }
.guide p { margin: 0 0 10px; max-width: 60ch; }
.codes { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
.codes li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 12px; align-items: center; }
.guide ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: grid; gap: 6px; max-width: 60ch; }

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { * { transition: none !important; animation: none !important; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
  <symbol id="i-home" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 11l9-8 9 8M5 10v10h14V10"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="i-shield" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V6z"/><path d="M8.5 12l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="i-drop" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3s6 6.5 6 11a6 6 0 0 1-12 0c0-4.5 6-11 6-11z"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="i-chat" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="i-flag" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 21V4M5 4h11l-2 4 2 4H5"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="i-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.7 2.7L16 9.5"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="i-alert" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l10 18H2z"/><path d="M12 10v4M12 17.5v.5"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="i-x" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9 9l6 6M15 9l-6 6"/></symbol>
</svg>

<div class="stage">
  <main class="app" aria-label="Zarishields prototype">
    <header class="app-head">
      <div class="brand"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg>Zarishields</div>
      <span class="pill">Prototype</span>
    </header>

    <div class="screens" id="screens">

      <!-- HOME -->
      <section class="screen" data-screen="home">
        <h1>Is your pad safe to use?</h1>
        <p class="lede">Check the pack code, then test the pad with the pH strip before you use it.</p>
        <button class="tile" data-go="check"><span class="badge"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></span><span><strong>Check a pack code</strong><span class="d">Find out if the pack is registered and genuine</span></span></button>
        <button class="tile" data-go="ph"><span class="badge"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-drop"/></svg></span><span><strong>Test with the pH strip</strong><span class="d">Match the strip colour to read the result</span></span></button>
        <button class="tile" data-go="sms"><span class="badge"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-chat"/></svg></span><span><strong>No data? Use SMS or USSD</strong><span class="d">Works on any phone, no internet needed</span></span></button>
        <button class="tile" data-go="report"><span class="badge"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-flag"/></svg></span><span><strong>Report a suspected fake</strong><span class="d">Warn others and help get it removed</span></span></button>
        <h2 class="label">Your current pack</h2>
        <div class="panel" id="homeStatus"></div>
        <div id="homeVerdict"></div>
        <button class="link" id="startOver" style="justify-self:start">Start over with a new pack</button>
      </section>

      <!-- CHECK -->
      <section class="screen" data-screen="check" hidden>
        <h1>Check a pack code</h1>
        <p class="lede">Type the code printed on the pack label.</p>
        <form id="checkForm" class="stack" style="display:grid;gap:12px" novalidate>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="code">Pack code</label>
            <input type="text" id="code" class="mono" placeholder="ZS-1001-AAAA" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false">
          </div>
          <button class="btn" type="submit">Check code</button>
        </form>
        <div>
          <p class="small" style="margin-bottom:8px">Try a demo code</p>
          <div class="chips">
            <button class="fill" data-fill="ZS-1001-AAAA">ZS-1001-AAAA</button>
            <button class="fill" data-fill="ZS-2002-BBBB">ZS-2002-BBBB</button>
            <button class="fill" data-fill="ZS-9999-XXXX">ZS-9999-XXXX</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="checkResult" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </section>

      <!-- PH -->
      <section class="screen" data-screen="ph" hidden>
        <h1>Test with the pH strip</h1>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>Put two drops of clean water on the pad's top layer.</li>
          <li>Press the strip on the damp spot for 10 seconds.</li>
          <li>Pick the colour your strip turned.</li>
        </ol>
        <div class="swatches" id="swatches" role="group" aria-label="Strip colour"></div>
        <div class="range"><span>More acidic</span><span>More alkaline</span></div>
        <div id="phResult" aria-live="polite"></div>
        <div id="phVerdict"></div>
        <p class="small">A pH reading is a screening step. It cannot prove a pad is genuine on its own, so use it together with the code check. The range used here (4.5 to 7.0) is a demo value.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- SMS / USSD -->
      <section class="screen" data-screen="sms" hidden>
        <h1>No data? No problem.</h1>
        <p class="lede">The same checks work by text message or USSD on any phone.</p>
        <div class="seg" role="group" aria-label="Channel">
          <button id="segSms" aria-pressed="true">SMS</button>
          <button id="segUssd" aria-pressed="false">USSD</button>
        </div>

        <div id="panelSms" class="screen">
          <p class="small">To: <span style="font-family:var(--font-mono)">30777</span> (demo number)</p>
          <div class="thread" id="thread" aria-live="polite"></div>
          <form class="send-row" id="smsForm" novalidate>
            <input type="text" id="smsInput" placeholder="CHECK ZS-1001-AAAA" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Your text message">
            <button class="btn sm" type="submit">Send</button>
          </form>
          <div class="chips">
            <button class="fill" data-sms="CHECK ZS-1001-AAAA">CHECK ZS-1001-AAAA</button>
            <button class="fill" data-sms="PH 6">PH 6</button>
            <button class="fill" data-sms="REPORT ZS-9999-XXXX">REPORT ZS-9999-XXXX</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="panelUssd" class="screen" hidden>
          <div class="dial">*347*77#</div>
          <button class="btn" id="dialBtn">Dial</button>
          <div class="ussd" id="ussd" hidden>
            <pre id="ussdText"></pre>
            <input type="text" id="ussdIn" inputmode="text" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Your reply">
            <div class="ussd-actions">
              <button class="btn ghost sm" id="ussdCancel" type="button" style="width:100%">Cancel</button>
              <button class="btn sm" id="ussdSend" type="button" style="width:100%">Send</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="small">USSD code is a demo value. Menus will also be offered in Hausa, Yoruba, Igbo and Pidgin.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- REPORT -->
      <section class="screen" data-screen="report" hidden>
        <h1>Report a suspected fake</h1>
        <p class="lede">Your report helps warn other users and flag the pack to the regulator.</p>
        <form id="reportForm" style="display:grid;gap:14px" novalidate>
          <div class="field"><label for="rCode">Pack code (if you have it)</label><input type="text" id="rCode" class="mono" placeholder="ZS-XXXX-XXXX" autocomplete="off"></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="rProduct">Product name</label><input type="text" id="rProduct" placeholder="Brand and pack size" autocomplete="off"></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="rWhere">Where did you buy it?</label>
            <select id="rWhere">
              <option>Open market</option><option>Pharmacy</option><option>Supermarket</option><option>Street vendor</option><option>Online</option><option>Other</option>
            </select></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="rState">State</label>
            <select id="rState">
              <option>FCT Abuja</option><option>Lagos</option><option>Kano</option><option>Kaduna</option><option>Rivers</option><option>Oyo</option><option>Enugu</option><option>Other</option>
            </select></div>
          <fieldset>
            <legend>What happened?</legend>
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox"> Rash or itching</label>
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox"> Burning feeling</label>
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox"> Unusual smell</label>
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox"> Pack was damp or torn</label>
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox"> Nothing yet, I am suspicious</label>
          </fieldset>
          <p class="err" id="rErr" role="alert" hidden>Enter the pack code or the product name.</p>
          <button class="btn" type="submit">Send report</button>
        </form>
        <div id="reportDone" hidden>
          <div class="result ok" role="status">
            <div class="r-head"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Report received</div>
            <p>Reference <strong id="refNo" style="font-family:var(--font-mono)"></strong>. Thank you for helping other women and girls.</p>
            <p class="small" style="color:inherit">If you have pain, swelling or a rash that will not settle, see a clinic or pharmacist.</p>
            <p class="small" style="color:inherit">Prototype only: nothing was sent or stored.</p>
            <button class="btn" id="reportAgain" type="button">Send another report</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <nav class="nav" aria-label="Main">
      <button data-go="home"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-home"/></svg>Home</button>
      <button data-go="check"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg>Check</button>
      <button data-go="ph"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-drop"/></svg>pH strip</button>
      <button data-go="sms"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-chat"/></svg>SMS/USSD</button>
      <button data-go="report"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-flag"/></svg>Report</button>
    </nav>
  </main>

  <aside class="guide">
    <h2>Zarishields prototype</h2>
    <p>A clickable demo of how Zarishields works. A user checks the pack code, tests the pad with a pH strip, and reports a suspected fake. The same checks run by SMS and USSD for phones without data.</p>
    <h3>Demo codes</h3>
    <ul class="codes">
      <li><button class="fill" data-fill="ZS-1001-AAAA">ZS-1001-AAAA</button><span>Registered batch, shows as verified</span></li>
      <li><button class="fill" data-fill="ZS-2002-BBBB">ZS-2002-BBBB</button><span>Checked many times, may be a copied label</span></li>
      <li><button class="fill" data-fill="ZS-9999-XXXX">ZS-9999-XXXX</button><span>Not in the register</span></li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Quick walk-through</h3>
    <ol>
      <li>Tap a demo code above to run the check.</li>
      <li>Open the pH strip tab and pick a colour. Colours 5 to 7 are in range.</li>
      <li>Return to Home to see the combined result.</li>
      <li>Open SMS/USSD, send a text or dial the USSD code.</li>
    </ol>
    <h3>About the demo values</h3>
    <p class="small">Codes, the SMS number, the USSD code, batch details and the pH range are all placeholders. Nothing here is sent or stored.</p>
  </aside>
</div>

<script>
